     7	repo). Every line carries a status and the command or path that proved it:
     8	
     9	  verified  a command run just now proved it
    10	  reported  a local file claims it (may be stale)
    11	  unknown   not provable on this machine
    12	  MISSING   expected and not there
    13	
    14	Generic by design (the skill is global): nothing hardcodes a project. Project
    15	extras come in through flags (--blueprint, --workflows).
    16	
    17	Usage:
    18	  readiness.py [--net] [--json] [--require TOOL ...] [--blueprint DIR]
    19	               [--workflows DIR] [--self-test]
